ggplotly(g)
```

#### Commenting on adjustment quality

Under-estimation on tails; Over-estimation on the middle of the interval; in overall good adjustment

### Diagnostics

#### Computing Deviance

```{r}
D <- 2*sum((n1*log((n1/n)/(p_hat+eps))+n0*log((n0/n + eps)/(1-p_hat+eps))))
D
```

#### Computing Pearson Statistics

```{r}
X <- sum(((n1 - n*p_hat)^2)/(n*(p_hat+eps)*(1-p_hat+eps)))
X
```
